sequenceDiagram
    participant Manager
    participant CaptureAgent
    participant ReviewStorageAgent
    Manager->>CaptureAgent: Provide route and run contract
    CaptureAgent->>CaptureAgent: Start app once
    CaptureAgent->>CaptureAgent: Navigate with Playwright MCP and capture screenshot
    CaptureAgent->>ReviewStorageAgent: Send screenshot and browser evidence
    ReviewStorageAgent->>ReviewStorageAgent: Review image and store project image asset
    ReviewStorageAgent->>Manager: Return storage receipt and findings
